                                "sense_id": "997c443c-e385-3347-a77b-84da304cfecc",
                                "text": "That each, who seems a separate whole,\n⁠Should move his rounds, and fusing all\n⁠The skirts of self again, should fall\nRemerging in the general Soul,\nIs faith as vague as all unsweet: […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2158baae-ec0d-4842-8350-396450892e77",
                                "sense_id": "997c443c-e385-3347-a77b-84da304cfecc",
                                "text": "Again I sank in that repose unsweet,\nAgain a clashing noise my slumber rent; […]"
